{"seq":1,"slug":"nucleophilic-substitution","title":"亲核取代反应 SN1/SN2（Nucleophilic Substitution: SN1 and SN2）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/reaction-mechanisms/nucleophilic-substitution","wordCount":2763,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"亲核取代反应-sn1-sn2-nucleophilic-substitution-sn1-and-sn2\">亲核取代反应 SN1/SN2（Nucleophilic Substitution: SN1 and SN2）</h1><h2 id=\"引言\">引言</h2><p>亲核取代反应（Nucleophilic Substitution）是有机化学中最基本、最重要的反应类型之一。在这类反应中，一个亲核试剂（Nucleophile，提供电子对的物种）进攻底物分子中带部分正电荷的碳原子，取代原有的离去基团（Leaving Group）。反应的总结果是：一根旧键断裂，一根新键形成。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>Nu</mtext><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mtext>R—LG</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>R—Nu</mtext><mo>+</mo><msup><mtext>LG</mtext><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Nu}^- + \\text{R—LG} \\rightarrow \\text{R—Nu} + \\text{LG}^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9279em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Nu</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R—LG</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R—Nu</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LG</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>亲核取代广泛存在于有机合成和生物化学中：DNA 的烷基化修复、药物的代谢活化、有机合成中的官能团转换（卤代烃 → 醇、胺、醚、腈等）都涉及这一反应。根据机理差异，亲核取代分为两种主要模式：SN2（二级亲核取代）和 SN1（一级亲核取代）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>亲核取代反应的判据是&quot;成键与断键的时序&quot;</strong>：新键形成与旧键断裂是同时发生（协同）还是先后分步，决定了两种机理在动力学、立体化学和底物偏好上的全部差异。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>SN2</strong>：一步协同。亲核试剂从离去基团背面进攻，过渡态为五配位碳。速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>底物</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>亲核试剂</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= k[\\text{底物}][\\text{亲核试剂}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">底物</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">亲核试剂</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>（二级），构型严格翻转。</li>\n<li><strong>SN1</strong>：分两步。先异裂生成平面三角碳正离子中间体，再由亲核试剂进攻。速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>底物</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= k[\\text{底物}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">底物</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>（一级），近外消旋化并可能重排。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>决定路径的四个变量</strong>——底物结构、亲核试剂强度、溶剂类型、离去基团能力——共同作用，其中底物碳的取代程度权重最高（叔碳几乎必走 SN1，甲基/伯碳偏好 SN2）。这不是非此即彼的开关，而是连续竞争；现实反应中两条路径常同时存在，只是比例不同。</p>\n<p><strong>常见误解</strong>：把&quot;SN1 一定外消旋、SN2 一定完全翻转&quot;当作绝对规律。实际上 SN1 常观察到一定程度的构型翻转占优（离子对效应），SN2 在特殊底物下也可能出现部分消旋。机理给出的是趋势与边界，而非逐分子的精确预言。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Q[&quot;亲核取代 R-LG + Nu⁻&quot;] --&gt; S{&quot;机理判断&quot;}&#10;  S --&gt;|&quot;甲基/伯碳 + 强亲核 + 极性非质子溶剂&quot;| SN2[&quot;SN2 一步协同&quot;]&#10;  S --&gt;|&quot;叔碳/烯丙基苄基 + 弱亲核(溶剂) + 极性质子溶剂&quot;| SN1[&quot;SN1 两步&quot;]&#10;  SN2 --&gt; SN2a[&quot;过渡态: 五配位碳&quot;]&#10;  SN2 --&gt; SN2b[&quot;二级动力学&quot;]&#10;  SN2 --&gt; SN2c[&quot;构型翻转 (Walden)&quot;]&#10;  SN1 --&gt; SN1a[&quot;中间体: 碳正离子&quot;]&#10;  SN1 --&gt; SN1b[&quot;一级动力学&quot;]&#10;  SN1 --&gt; SN1c[&quot;近外消旋 + 可能重排&quot;]\">graph TD\n  Q[\"亲核取代 R-LG + Nu⁻\"] --&gt; S{\"机理判断\"}\n  S --&gt;|\"甲基/伯碳 + 强亲核 + 极性非质子溶剂\"| SN2[\"SN2 一步协同\"]\n  S --&gt;|\"叔碳/烯丙基苄基 + 弱亲核(溶剂) + 极性质子溶剂\"| SN1[\"SN1 两步\"]\n  SN2 --&gt; SN2a[\"过渡态: 五配位碳\"]\n  SN2 --&gt; SN2b[\"二级动力学\"]\n  SN2 --&gt; SN2c[\"构型翻转 (Walden)\"]\n  SN1 --&gt; SN1a[\"中间体: 碳正离子\"]\n  SN1 --&gt; SN1b[\"一级动力学\"]\n  SN1 --&gt; SN1c[\"近外消旋 + 可能重排\"]</pre><h2 id=\"sn2-反应机理\">SN2 反应机理</h2><h3 id=\"机理描述\">机理描述</h3><p>SN2（Substitution Nucleophilic Bimolecular）是一步协同反应：亲核试剂从离去基团的背面进攻（back-side attack），在<strong>同一个过渡态</strong>中，新的 Nu—C 键形成的同时旧的 C—LG 键断裂。</p>\n<p>反应坐标上只有一个能量最高点（过渡态），没有中间体。过渡态的结构为五配位碳，亲核试剂和离去基团分别位于碳原子两侧，三个未参与取代的基团在一个平面上——呈三角双锥形。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msup><mtext>Nu</mtext><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow></msup><mo>⋯</mo><mtext>C</mtext><mo>⋯</mo><msup><mtext>LG</mtext><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">‡</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\text{Nu}^{\\delta-} \\cdots \\text{C} \\cdots \\text{LG}^{\\delta-}]^{\\ddagger}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1723em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Nu</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9223em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LG</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9223em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">‡</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"动力学特征\">动力学特征</h3><p>SN2 反应速率同时取决于底物和亲核试剂的浓度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Rate</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>Substrate</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>Nucleophile</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Rate} = k[\\text{Substrate}][\\text{Nucleophile}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Rate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Substrate</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Nucleophile</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这是二级反应（Bimolecular），反应速率取决于两个分子在同一时刻碰撞的概率。速率常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 遵循 Arrhenius 方程，与活化能 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 成指数负相关。</p>\n<h3 id=\"立体化学结果\">立体化学结果</h3><p>SN2 反应的立体化学结果是严格的<strong>构型翻转</strong>（Walden Inversion）：产物的立体中心构型与底物恰好相反。这一结果的物理原因是亲核试剂只能从离去基团的背面进攻——前方被离去基团阻挡。</p>\n<p>类比&quot;翻雨伞&quot;：当大风（亲核试剂）从雨伞背面吹来，伞骨（三个取代基）翻转到另一侧。</p>\n<p>这一立体化学特征是验证 SN2 机理的关键实验证据。1923 年 Paul Walden 首次观察到手性化合物在亲核取代后构型反转的现象。</p>\n<h3 id=\"底物结构的影响\">底物结构的影响</h3><p>SN2 反应速率对底物碳原子的取代程度极其敏感：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>底物类型</th>\n<th>相对速率</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>甲基 (CH₃—X)</td>\n<td>最快 (~30)</td>\n<td>无空间位阻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>伯碳 (RCH₂—X)</td>\n<td>快 (1)</td>\n<td>位阻小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仲碳 (R₂CH—X)</td>\n<td>慢 (~0.03)</td>\n<td>中等位阻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>叔碳 (R₃C—X)</td>\n<td>极慢/不反应</td>\n<td>严重位阻，背面进攻被阻断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>物理原因：亲核试剂必须从背面接近反应碳，碳上的烷基越大，背面越拥挤（空间位阻 / Steric Hindrance），过渡态能量越高。对于叔碳底物，SN2 在实验条件下基本不发生。</p>\n<h3 id=\"亲核试剂的强弱\">亲核试剂的强弱</h3><p>常见亲核试剂按亲核性由强到弱排列（在极性非质子溶剂中）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>RS</mtext><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mtext>I</mtext><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mtext>CN</mtext><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mtext>RO</mtext><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mtext>HO</mtext><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mtext>Br</mtext><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mtext>Cl</mtext><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mtext>F</mtext><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>O</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RS}^- &gt; \\text{I}^- &gt; \\text{CN}^- &gt; \\text{RO}^- &gt; \\text{HO}^- &gt; \\text{Br}^- &gt; \\text{Cl}^- &gt; \\text{F}^- &gt; \\text{H}_2\\text{O}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8837em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RS</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8837em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">I</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8837em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CN</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8837em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8837em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8837em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Br</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8948em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cl</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8557em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8837em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">F</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>亲核性影响因素：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>可极化性</strong>（Polarizability）：原子越大越容易变形，与正电碳的相互作用越好（如 I⁻ &gt; Cl⁻）</li>\n<li><strong>碱性</strong>：同一周期内碱性越强亲核性越强（如 RO⁻ &gt; HO⁻ &gt; RCO₂⁻）</li>\n<li><strong>溶剂效应</strong>：质子性溶剂（水、醇）通过氢键溶剂化削弱小而硬的亲核试剂（F⁻），非质子溶剂（DMF、DMSO）中亲核性更接近气相趋势</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"离去基团\">离去基团</h3><p>好的离去基团特征是：离开后形成稳定的物种（弱碱）。常见离去基团按能力排列：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>TfO</mtext><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mtext>TsO</mtext><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mtext>I</mtext><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mtext>Br</mtext><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mtext>Cl</mtext><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mtext>F</mtext><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mtext>HO</mtext><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{TfO}^- &gt; \\text{TsO}^- &gt; \\text{I}^- &gt; \\text{Br}^- &gt; \\text{Cl}^- &gt; \\text{F}^- &gt; \\text{HO}^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8948em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TfO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8557em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8837em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TsO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8837em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">I</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8837em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Br</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8948em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cl</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8557em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8837em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">F</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>水（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>O</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{H}_2\\text{O}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span></span></span></span></span>）是良好的离去基团（前提是先将醇质子化为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mtext>ROH</mtext><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ROH}_2^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0916em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ROH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），而 HO⁻ 和 RO⁻ 是极差的离去基团——它们是强碱，离开后体系不稳定。这就是为什么醇不能直接进行亲核取代，必须先活化（例如转化为 tosylate 或用酸质子化）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sn1-反应机理\">SN1 反应机理</h2><h3 id=\"机理描述\">机理描述</h3><p>SN1（Substitution Nucleophilic Unimolecular）是两步反应：</p>\n<p><strong>步骤 1</strong>（决速步）：C—LG 键异裂，离去基团带走键合电子对离开，生成碳正离子（Carbocation）中间体。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>R—LG</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>slow</mtext></mpadded></mover><msup><mtext>R</mtext><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mtext>LG</mtext><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{R—LG} \\xrightarrow{\\text{slow}} \\text{R}^+ + \\text{LG}^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1191em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R—LG</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1081em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">slow</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9279em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LG</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>步骤 2</strong>（快步）：亲核试剂从碳正离子的任意一面进攻，形成新键。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>R</mtext><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mtext>Nu</mtext><mo>−</mo></msup><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>fast</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>R—Nu</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{R}^+ + \\text{Nu}^- \\xrightarrow{\\text{fast}} \\text{R—Nu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9279em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1191em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Nu</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1081em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fast</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R—Nu</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>反应坐标上有两个过渡态和一个中间体（碳正离子位于能量谷中）。第一步的活化能决定总反应速率。</p>\n<h3 id=\"动力学特征\">动力学特征</h3><p>SN1 反应速率只取决于底物浓度，与亲核试剂无关：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Rate</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>Substrate</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Rate} = k[\\text{Substrate}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Rate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Substrate</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这是一级反应（Unimolecular）。决速步只涉及底物的 C—LG 键断裂，亲核试剂在第二步才参与——其浓度变化不影响反应速率。</p>\n<h3 id=\"碳正离子稳定性\">碳正离子稳定性</h3><p>SN1 反应能否发生，取决于碳正离子中间体的稳定性。碳正离子稳定性排序：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>叔碳</mtext><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mtext>仲碳</mtext><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mtext>伯碳</mtext><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mtext>甲基</mtext><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{叔碳}^+ &gt; \\text{仲碳}^+ &gt; \\text{伯碳}^+ &gt; \\text{甲基}^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8837em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">叔碳</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8837em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">仲碳</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8837em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">伯碳</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">甲基</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>稳定化因素：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>超共轭效应</strong>（Hyperconjugation）：相邻 C—H σ 键轨道与空 p 轨道重叠，分散正电荷。烷基越多，超共轭越充分。</li>\n<li><strong>诱导效应</strong>（Inductive Effect）：烷基是弱给电子基，通过 σ 键传递电子密度。</li>\n<li><strong>共轭稳定化</strong>：烯丙基碳正离子和苄基碳正离子因 p 轨道与相邻 π 体系共轭而额外稳定。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>因此 SN1 反应活性排序与 SN2 恰好相反：叔碳 &gt; 仲碳 &gt; 伯碳。</p>\n<h3 id=\"立体化学结果\">立体化学结果</h3><p>理论上，平面三角形的碳正离子应该被亲核试剂从两面等概率进攻，产生外消旋体（50% R + 50% S）。但实验中常观察到轻微的<strong>构型翻转过量</strong>（如 60% 翻转 + 40% 保留），原因是离去基团刚离开时仍停留在附近（离子对效应），暂时阻挡了亲核试剂从该面进攻。</p>\n<h3 id=\"碳正离子重排\">碳正离子重排</h3><p>碳正离子中间体可能发生<strong>重排</strong>（Rearrangement）——通过相邻碳上的 H 或烷基的 1,2-迁移，形成更稳定的碳正离子。这是 SN1 反应的重要特征（也是&quot;副反应陷阱&quot;）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>氢迁移</strong>（1,2-Hydride Shift）：仲碳正离子上相邻碳的 H 带着电子对迁移，形成叔碳正离子</li>\n<li><strong>甲基迁移</strong>（1,2-Methyl Shift）：类似，但迁移的是甲基</li>\n</ul>\n<p>例如：2-溴-3-甲基丁烷在 SN1 条件下水解，不仅生成 3-甲基-2-丁醇，还产生 2-甲基-2-丁醇——后者正是经氢迁移产生的叔碳正离子被水进攻的产物。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sn1-与-sn2-的竞争与判断\">SN1 与 SN2 的竞争与判断</h2><h3 id=\"决定因素总结\">决定因素总结</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>因素</th>\n<th>有利于 SN2</th>\n<th>有利于 SN1</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>底物</td>\n<td>甲基、伯碳</td>\n<td>叔碳、烯丙/苄基</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>亲核试剂</td>\n<td>强亲核试剂（浓）</td>\n<td>弱亲核试剂（溶剂）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>溶剂</td>\n<td>极性非质子（DMF, DMSO）</td>\n<td>极性质子（H₂O, MeOH）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>离去基团</td>\n<td>好的离去基团</td>\n<td>好的离去基团</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>温度</td>\n<td>低温</td>\n<td>高温（利于键断裂）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"实际判断流程\">实际判断流程</h3><ol>\n<li>先看底物：叔碳 → 必定 SN1（或 E1）；甲基/伯碳 → 必定 SN2（若条件合适）</li>\n<li>仲碳是&quot;灰色地带&quot;——需综合考虑亲核试剂、溶剂和温度</li>\n<li>若有强亲核试剂 + 极性非质子溶剂 → SN2 占优</li>\n<li>若溶剂即为亲核试剂（如 H₂O, MeOH 溶剂解）→ SN1 占优</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"实际应用\">实际应用</h3><p><strong>合成应用</strong>（SN2）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>卤代烃 + NaCN → 腈（碳链延长一个碳）</li>\n<li>卤代烃 + NaN₃ → 叠氮化物（后可还原为胺）</li>\n<li>卤代烃 + NaOAc → 酯</li>\n<li>Williamson 醚合成：RO⁻ + R&#39;X → R—O—R&#39;</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>生物化学中的 SN2</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>SAM（S-腺苷甲硫氨酸）的甲基转移反应是生物体内最常见的 SN2 反应</li>\n<li>DNA 甲基化酶使用 SAM 作为甲基供体</li>\n<li>谷胱甘肽 S-转移酶催化的解毒反应也遵循 SN2 机理</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"溶剂效应的深入分析\">溶剂效应的深入分析</h2><h3 id=\"极性质子溶剂\">极性质子溶剂</h3><p>水、甲醇、乙醇等含 O—H 或 N—H 的溶剂能通过氢键溶剂化离子。它们：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>稳定碳正离子和离去基团负离子 → 促进 SN1</li>\n<li>通过氢键&quot;包裹&quot;小而硬的亲核试剂（如 F⁻、HO⁻），降低其有效亲核性 → 不利于 SN2</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"极性非质子溶剂\">极性非质子溶剂</h3><p>DMF（N,N-二甲基甲酰胺）、DMSO（二甲基亚砜）、丙酮等只含 C=O 极性基团但无 O—H 的溶剂：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>不能通过氢键溶剂化阴离子 → 亲核试剂保持&quot;裸露&quot;的高反应性</li>\n<li>通过偶极-偶极相互作用溶解离子化合物</li>\n<li>显著提高 SN2 反应速率（可达在质子性溶剂中的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^3 - 10^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 倍）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这就是为什么实验室进行 SN2 反应时，DMF 和 DMSO 是首选溶剂。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章小结\">本章小结</h2><p>亲核取代反应是有机化学最基本的成键方式之一。理解 SN1 和 SN2 两种机理的区别，关键在于把握：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>SN2</strong>：一步协同、二级动力学、构型翻转、底物位阻敏感</li>\n<li><strong>SN1</strong>：两步经碳正离子、一级动力学、近外消旋化、底物稳定性驱动</li>\n<li><strong>竞争判断</strong>：底物结构是最重要的决定因素，辅以亲核试剂强度和溶剂类型</li>\n<li><strong>碳正离子重排</strong>：SN1 特有的&quot;陷阱&quot;，产物可能与预期不同</li>\n</ol>\n<p>掌握这两种机理后，面对任何亲核取代问题都能做到&quot;先判断机理路径，再预测产物结构和立体化学&quot;——这正是有机化学思维训练的核心目标。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"亲核取代反应 SN1/SN2（Nucleophilic Substitution: SN1 and SN2）","id":"亲核取代反应-sn1-sn2-nucleophilic-substitution-sn1-and-sn2"},{"level":2,"text":"引言","id":"引言"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"SN2 反应机理","id":"sn2-反应机理"},{"level":3,"text":"机理描述","id":"机理描述"},{"level":3,"text":"动力学特征","id":"动力学特征"},{"level":3,"text":"立体化学结果","id":"立体化学结果"},{"level":3,"text":"底物结构的影响","id":"底物结构的影响"},{"level":3,"text":"亲核试剂的强弱","id":"亲核试剂的强弱"},{"level":3,"text":"离去基团","id":"离去基团"},{"level":2,"text":"SN1 反应机理","id":"sn1-反应机理"},{"level":3,"text":"机理描述","id":"机理描述"},{"level":3,"text":"动力学特征","id":"动力学特征"},{"level":3,"text":"碳正离子稳定性","id":"碳正离子稳定性"},{"level":3,"text":"立体化学结果","id":"立体化学结果"},{"level":3,"text":"碳正离子重排","id":"碳正离子重排"},{"level":2,"text":"SN1 与 SN2 的竞争与判断","id":"sn1-与-sn2-的竞争与判断"},{"level":3,"text":"决定因素总结","id":"决定因素总结"},{"level":3,"text":"实际判断流程","id":"实际判断流程"},{"level":3,"text":"实际应用","id":"实际应用"},{"level":2,"text":"溶剂效应的深入分析","id":"溶剂效应的深入分析"},{"level":3,"text":"极性质子溶剂","id":"极性质子溶剂"},{"level":3,"text":"极性非质子溶剂","id":"极性非质子溶剂"},{"level":2,"text":"本章小结","id":"本章小结"}],"prev":{"title":"立体化学：手性与构象（Stereochemistry: Chirality and Conformation）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/structure-nomenclature/stereochemistry"},"next":{"title":"消除反应 E1/E2（Elimination Reactions: E1 and E2）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/reaction-mechanisms/elimination-reactions"}}